### 11.3 建議的匯出格式規格

**格式 1：Lightweight JSON (nodes + edges)**
```json
{
  "version": "1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "repo": "facebook/react",
    "commit": "a1b2c3d",
    "analyzed_at": "2026-03-14T18:31:00Z",
    "gitnexus_version": "1.1.7"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "useState",
      "file": "packages/react/src/ReactHooks.js",
      "line": 42,
      "importance": 0.95
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "source": "n1",
      "target": "n2",
      "type": "calls"
    }
  ],
  "clusters": [
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "name": "react-reconciler",
      "members": ["n1", "n3", "n5"]
    }
  ]
}
```

**格式 2：GraphML (標準交換格式)**
```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns">
  <key id="name" for="node" attr.name="name" attr.type="string"/>
  <key id="type" for="edge" attr.name="type" attr.type="string"/>
  <graph edgedefault="directed">
    <node id="n1">
      <data key="name">useState</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="n1" target="n2">
      <data key="type">calls</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
</graphml>
```

**格式 3：Cypher 重建腳本**
```cypher
// 建立節點
CREATE (n1:Function {name: 'useState', file: 'ReactHooks.js'});
CREATE (n2:Function {name: 'useEffect', file: 'ReactHooks.js'});

// 建立關係
MATCH (a:Function {name: 'useState'}), (b:Function {name: 'dispatcher'})
CREATE (a)-[:CALLS]->(b);
```

